codex
The root cause is concrete: this sandbox reports namespace PID `2`, while `/proc` exposes host PIDs, so Lean’s `readlink("/proc/2/exe")` fails. I’m applying a narrow audit-local preload shim that redirects only `/proc/<current-pid>/exe` to `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter Lean sources, generated files, or theorem checking. I’ll record the shim source and use it for the trusted preflight rerun.
apply patch
